WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.799
DR. RODGERS: Are you looking for online health
information you can trust?

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:08.430
Try the National Library of Medicine’s MedlinePlus
website!

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:12.690
Hi, I’m Dr. Griffin Rodgers, director of
the National Institute of Diabetes and Digestive

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.430
and Kidney Diseases at NIH.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:21.542
My colleague, Dr. Patti Brennan, director
of the National Library of Medicine, or NLM, explains.

00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:27.320
DR. BRENNAN: MedlinePlus is a website designed
by NLM for you, your family, and your friends.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:32.590
It offers reliable, free, easy-to-understand
information covering more than one thousand

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:34.350
health and wellness topics.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:38.860
With MedlinePlus, we have carefully brought
together evidence-based information from many

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:42.180
reliable sources – and it’s all in one
place.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.340
For example, if you are looking for information
on a topic such as blood pressure medication,

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:49.989
you may also want resources about nutrition
and physical activity.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:53.800
Learn more at medlineplus.gov and on social
media.

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.120
DR. RODGERS: For more information, follow us @NIDDKgov.

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:00.476
This is Dr. Griffin Rodgers.

